"            store it in the directory /etc/linuxmuster/sophomorix/SCHOOL/"
"latex-templates/.<br>\n"
"            It <strong>must</strong> follow the naming convention\n"
"            <quote>&lt;SCHOOLNAME&gt;.&lt;TEMPLATENAME&gt;-&lt;LANG>-"
"&lt;NUM&gt;-template.tex</quote> as specified in\n"
"            <a href=\"https://github.com/linuxmuster/sophomorix4/blob/bionic/"
"sophomorix-samba/lang/latex/README.latextemplates\">in sophomorix's wiki</"
"a>.\n"
"            <br>\n"
"            <br>\n"
"            If you want to define a template for <strong>all schools</"
"strong>, please store it in\n"
"            /usr/share/sophomorix/lang/latex/templates/. <br>\n"
"            It <strong>must</strong> follow the naming convention\n"
"            <quote>&lt;TEMPLATENAME&gt;-&lt;LANG>-&lt;NUM&gt;-template.tex</"
"quote> as specified in\n"
"            <a href=\"https://github.com/linuxmuster/sophomorix4/blob/bionic/"
"sophomorix-samba/lang/latex/README.latextemplates\">in sophomorix's wiki</a>."
